OL,3,GNEWSARoman altar on display amid hopes
OL,4,Afor more digs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Roman altar celebrating a soldier's
OL,7,Fsafe return home is going on display
OL,8,Famid hopes for more excavations at the
OL,9,Fsite where it was found more than a
OL,10,Fdecade ago.
OL,12,FThe 1751-year-old artefact was
OL,13,Fdiscovered at Binchester Roman Fort,
OL,14,Fnear Bishop Auckland, in 2013, and will
OL,15,Fbe shown at the town's Faith Museum.
OL,17,FIt dates to about AD 275 and was
OL,18,Fdedicated to Fortuna Redux - the Roman
OL,19,Fgoddess of safe homecoming - by a
OL,20,Fretired military architect named
OL,21,FEltaominus.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
