OL,3,GNEWSARoman altar on display amid hopes
OL,4,Afor more digs
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeology curator Dr John Castling
OL,7,Fsaid the altar gave a "rare insight
OL,8,Finto the life and beliefs of an
OL,9,Findividual who lived at Binchester"
OL,10,Falmost two millennia ago.
